  "problem": "Managed accounting observations can be timestamped after immutable Revision publication. Treating that metadata as later model execution rejected a valid checkpoint and left TurnJournal checkpointing.",
  "repair": "Exclude only the exact deployed Managed accounting-only provider.status envelope from the execution-evidence timestamp lower bound; preserve all existing immutable events and receipts. Other provider, assistant and tool evidence remains subject to the timestamp check.",
  "regressions": [
    "Already-checkpointing Turn recovers from the original immutable receipt while admission is closed.",
    "Saved Session/workspace head advances without modifying or duplicating the existing accounting event.",
    "Both unknown and observed usage observations remain unchanged.",
    "Additional provider fields, wrong backend, malformed usage totals, late tool events and late assistant output still reject a checkpoint older than execution evidence."
  ],
